  "_expect": {
    "placement": "Every card lands on a legal slot; solver reports FEASIBLE/TIMEOUT with zero hard conflicts.",
    "rel_n0": "s_n0a (c2) and s_n0b (c2, G2) NEVER in adjacent periods of the same day.",
    "rel_n1": "s_n1a and s_n1b NEVER same day.",
    "rel_n2": "s_n2a (G1 Boys) and s_n2b (G2 Girls) never share (day,period). They share a division (divisionTag=1) with disjoint group bits -> canPlace must treat as same-division -> n_2 applies.",
