    "bell_short_sparse": "c3 school uses 'shortsparse' bell with indexes [1,2,4,5]; index 3 non-dense gap must never host a c3 card.",
    "rel_n16": "Every s_n16 card sits with its span touching a day edge (starts period 1 or ends last teaching period).",
    "n5_n6_n8_n9": "Present as observable solver-pressure relations; hard-only correctness asserted.",
    "n5_disabled_baseline": "n_5 'must follow any order' is INVERTED in the current relation_enforcer (it rejects adjacent placement, mirroring n_0). With it enabled N5-B is unplaceable (audit finding #4 — relation_enforcer.js n_5 uses scope 'consecutive'). It is disabled here so Phase 0 has a GREEN oracle; Phase 3 (relation semantics) re-enables it as its fail-before test. Removes 2 lesson-slots of pressure.",
    "_solver_expected_sessions": "3 core(c1,c2,c3: 5+5+4=14) + 3 lab doubles(2 cards each x2 slots; sessions=6) + 13 relation lessons x 1ppw = 30 sessions / 36 card-periods."
